Beauty on The Corner- Zoya Nail Polish, Get 3 for Free
Hey honeybuns, so we are all nail fanatics over here on the corner so we jump at opportunities like this. The promotion started yesterday January 7th, but up until January 13th you can pick three bottles of Zoya polish for FREE. You just pay $10 for shipping and processing. So basically you&amp;#8217;re paying $10 for 3 bottles of polish that normally cost $8 each.&nbsp;
I&amp;#8217;m still deciding if I want to order. I did this with them before and one of my polishes was out of stock and they didn&amp;#8217;t send anything in it&amp;#8217;s place nor offer an apology. But I&amp;#8217;m a sucker for polishes so I may suck it up.&nbsp;
This is exclusively for www.zoya.com. Use promotional code- Zoya2013&nbsp;
Let me know what colors you all got. The have great shades.&nbsp;
xo Brandis&nbsp;
